  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Axu42vQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">NumismaticClaim 是一款用於相容 NumismaticOverhaul 與 OPAC 的模組。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它新增了向特定村民購買額外領地的功能。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yx7Ye7m.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"498\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oCrtfsy.gifv\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"Fabric API\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組為 Fabric 平台開發。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前沒有開發 Forge 版本的計畫。&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">整合包授權：<strong><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">歡迎在任意整合包中使用本模組</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">問題回報：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">請至 GitHub 頁面回報錯誤</span></p>",
